    <!-- Privacy screen -->
    <string name="privacy_title">Your privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">SafeShield collects no personal data.\n\n• Every scan runs on your device using a built-in signature database.\n• We have no account system, no analytics and no tracking SDKs.\n• We never read your messages, contacts, photos or location.\n• Nothing is shared with third parties.\n\nIf you switch on online mode, SafeShield sends one thing to VirusTotal: the SHA-256 hash of a file. A hash is a fingerprint — the file itself never leaves your phone. If you check a link, that single URL is sent to Google Safe Browsing. Both are off by default.\n\nScan history and settings are stored only in the app\'s private storage and are wiped by \"Delete all my data\".</string>

